{"lyrics":"[Intro: Young Thug & J. Cole]\n[00:00.00](\n[00:01.84]You good, T-Minus?\n[00:03.26])\n[00:03.52]Uh\n[Chorus: Young Thug]\n[00:03.58]The Rolls Royce is grey, I've been callin' it granny\n[00:05.34]I copped that Lamb' truck and that bitch panoramic (Skrrt)\n[00:07.18]I'm fuckin' on lil' shawty, mama, and granny\n[00:08.96]I'm takin' up space and they squish me like sandwiches\n[00:10.90]Fuck what I did, and fuck all the damage\n[00:12.58]I'm tryna kill you and your kid and your mammy (Brr)\n[00:14.42]I just told the judge, \"Man, fuck what you talkin'\"\n[00:16.22]And fuck what you sayin', I'm smokin' these whammies (Ha)\n[00:18.04]These Percys, these Xannies, I'm pourin' up this Actavis (Woo)\n[00:20.34]I'm failin' this test every time (Yeah)\n[00:22.16]I fingered this ho while we ridin' (Yeah)\n[00:23.98]I'm 'bout to expose you with rhymes (Yeah)\n[00:25.86]I came out the zoo with these guys (Yeah)\n[00:27.66]I slept in the woods with the guys (Yeah)\n[00:29.76]Get out the way when they come (Yeah)\n[00:31.26]Of course, the whole crew with the shine (Woo)\n[Verse 1: Young Thug & Juice WRLD]\n[00:33.26]I just did a week in jail and I caught me three new bitches (No cap)\n[00:36.70]Before you knew Dapper Dan, bitch, I was Grandpa Drippin' (\n[00:39.62]On God\n[00:40.46])\n[00:40.52]I had a million dollars stashed away in a spot on the westside (Woo)\n[00:44.22]I bulletproofed the whole car, the stickers on the windows and all of the tires (Yeah)\n[00:47.86]I gave a million dollars to my dawg, now a nigga worldwide (Yeah)\n[00:52.12]Yeah, I got a collar on my ho\n[00:55.56]I'm puttin' diamonds on her toes\n[00:58.66]Nigga, we came from cookin' noodles on the stove (Woo, woo, woo)\n[Chorus: Young Thug]\n[01:01.60]The Rolls Royce is grey, I've been callin' it granny\n[01:03.50]I copped that Lamb' truck and that bitch panoramic (Skrrt)\n[01:05.32]I'm fuckin' on lil' shawty, mama, and granny\n[01:07.14]I'm takin' up space and they squish me like sandwiches\n[01:09.10]Fuck what I did, and fuck all the damage\n[01:10.78]I'm tryna kill you and your kid and your mammy (Brr)\n[01:12.60]I just told the judge, \"Man, fuck what you talkin'\"\n[01:14.40]And fuck what you sayin', I'm smokin' these whammies (Ha)\n[01:16.20]These Percys, these Xannies, I'm pourin' up this Actavis (Woo)\n[01:18.52]I'm failin' this test every time (Yeah)\n[01:20.36]I fingered this ho while we ridin' (Yeah)\n[01:22.16]I'm 'bout to expose you with rhymes (Yeah)\n[01:24.04]I came out the zoo with these guys (Yeah)\n[01:25.82]I slept in the woods with the guys (Yeah)\n[01:27.74]Get out the way when they come (Yeah)\n[01:29.42]Of course, the whole crew with the shine (Woo)\n[Verse 2: Juice WRLD]\n[01:31.48]Off of the Perc' and the Xan' again, yeah (Woah, woah, woah, yeah)\n[01:33.32]Walk in the sky like I'm Anakin, yeah (Woah, woah, yeah)\n[01:35.14]Double G on me like mannequin, yeah (Woah, woah, yeah)\n[01:36.54]Make 'em freeze like the mannequin challenge in here (Uh-huh, uh-huh, yeah)\n[01:38.74]Me and Slatt dealin' the damage (Yeah)\n[01:39.98]Kidnap the children and murder the parents (Yeah)\n[01:41.90]I went to Mexico, I brought the pesos (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[01:43.54]Fucked her, say hola, I'm screamin' in Spanish (Yeah)\n[01:45.36]I got the tool, no Handy Manny (Chk-chk, grra)\n[01:47.32]You will get jacked, son, like you Randy (Grra)\n[01:49.20]I told that bitch to go swallow my kids\n[01:51.04]I don't even wanna have no family (Yeah)\n[01:52.72]It's me and Thugger, we rulin' the planet, yeah\n[01:55.04]We goin' harder than granite\n[01:56.44]Money old enough to fuck up your granny, yeah\n[01:58.76]I might go fuck on your granny (Slatt)\n[Chorus: Young Thug]\n[01:59.92]The Rolls Royce is grey, I've been callin' it granny\n[02:01.68]I copped that Lamb' truck and that bitch panoramic (Skrrt)\n[02:03.52]I'm fuckin' on lil' shawty, mama, and granny\n[02:05.32]I'm takin' up space and they squish me like sandwiches\n[02:07.28]Fuck what I did, and f